# Lesson 9-6 — Comparing Sets of Data

Source: Module 9, Lesson 9-6, `Int1_0906_practice.docx`.

## Transformation Rule

When each value is multiplied by a negative constant `k`, keep the sign for measures of center. Multiply the mean, median, and each mode by k. Multiply the range and standard deviation by |k|.

